    "chunk_text": "ses swustor; heo gesamnode ealle \u00fea wifmen tog\u00e6dere on Israhela cynne; & Witodlice Moyses l\u00e6dde Israhela folc fram \u00f0\u00e6re Readan S\u00e6, & hi foron on an westen, \u00f0e is Sur \u00d0a gegaderode eall \u00f0\u00e6t Israhelisce folc ongean Moyses & Aaron, & cw\u00e6don: Hw\u00e6t sceolon we \u00d0a clypode Moyses to Drihtne, & s\u00e6de him \u00f0\u00e6s folces neode: \u00f0a \u00e6teowde Drihten Moyse an \u00d0a comon hi to Helim, & \u00f0\u00e6r w\u00e6ron twelf wyllas & hundseofonti palmtreowa, & wicodon \u00f0\u00e6r be \u00deA ferdon hi \u00f0anon on \u00f0am fiftigo\u00f0an d\u00e6ge \u00fe\u00e6s \u00e6ftran mon\u00f0es \u00f0\u00e6s \u00f0e hi ut ferdon of Egypta lande. \u00d0a gegaderode eft eall \u00f0\u00e6t Israhelisce folc tog\u00e6dere ongean Moyses & Aaron, & cw\u00e6don: We \u00d0a gehyrde Drihten Israheles folces murcnunge, \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Drihten to Moyse: To \u00e6fen ic sende \u00feison Hit gewear\u00f0 \u00f0a on \u00e6fen \u00f0\u00e6t Drihten gesende swa micel fugelcyn on heora wicstowe swilce \u00d0a hi \u00f0\u00e6t gesawon, \u00f0a cw\u00e6don hi betwynan him, Manhu; \u00f0\u00e6t is, Hw\u00e6t is \u00f0is; for \u00f0am hi nyston & bebead \u00f0\u00e6t \u00e6lc man gaderie swa micel, \u00f0\u00e6t he genoh h\u00e6bbe to etenne, \u00fe\u00e6t is an gemetf\u00e6t ful, \u00fee & Israhela bearn didon swa, & gadrodon, sum mare sum l\u00e6sse. Se \u00f0e mare gegaderode",
